   'deep',
   '{"_raw":"{ summary: \"Set X-Frame-Options or CSP frame-ancestors on all pages that should not be framed.\", steps: [ \"Add Content-Security-Policy frame-ancestors ''self'' or X-Frame-Options: DENY.\", \"Gate clickjacking training labs behind authenticated sessions.\", \"Use frame-busting JavaScript only as defense-in-depth, not primary protection.\" ] }"}'::jsonb,
   'Our clickjacking lab page lacks X-Frame-Options and CSP frame-ancestors. Show how to prevent UI redress attacks.',
